{"text": "Still wishing to find the answers, the king decided to visit a hermit who was famous for his wisdom. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The hermit lived in a forest and never left it, and he met only simple, common people. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So the king put on simple clothes, and leaving his bodyguards behind, he walked to the hut alone. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When the king arrived, the old hermit was digging the ground in front of his hut. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was so weak that he breathed heavily every time he pushed his spade into the earth. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The king went up to him and said, I have come to you, wise hermit, to ask you three questions. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The hermit listened to the questions, but he answered nothing and went on digging. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You are tired, said the king, Let me take the spade and work for a while. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The hermit gave him the spade and sat down on the ground, and the king dug two beds. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When the king asked his questions again, the hermit only stood up and held out his hand for the spade. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the king did not give it back and kept digging until the sun began to sink behind the trees.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "t", "i", "l", "l", " ", "w", "i", "s", "h", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "o", " ", "f", "i", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "a", "n", "s", "w", "e", "r", "s", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "k", "i", "n", "g", " ", "d", "e", "c", "i", "d", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "v", "i", "s", "i", "t", " ", "a", " ", "h", "e", "r", "m", "i", "t", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "f", "a", "m", "o", "u", "s", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "w", "i", "s", "d", "o", "m", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "h", "e", "r", "m", "i", "t", " ", "l", "i", "v", "e", "d", " ", "i", "n", " ", "a", " ", 